## Design direction

A practical golf-cleaning accessory that gives club, event or sponsor artwork a useful place in a player gift set.

For custom golf brushes, begin with the part of the artwork that must read first. Keep the outline, smallest lettering, color breaks and functional details clear, then use finish and presentation to support the design rather than compete with it.

## Confirmed choices and project decisions

- Material, construction, dimensions, finish and packaging are confirmed from the approved project brief.

## Preparing your brief

Send the artwork, intended dimensions, quantity, delivery destination and required timing. Note which surfaces, moving parts, attachments or packaging details matter most so the quotation can be based on one clear specification.

Golden One will use the approved brief as the basis for the final product specification; unconfirmed materials, claims and performance details are not assumed.
